      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry for the delay. It\u0027s now in the right place, but we\u0027ll need to set up the current limits appropriately. We can send this CL with a 3A current limit. (I think it should be 3.08A instead of 3.2A) But really, we need to change that limit depending up our source caps.",
