      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-11-23T05:37:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it makes sense. Thanks for clarifying it. \n\nBut the VBUS_CURRENT_TARGET (0x92) has 32mA LSB; therefore, we can only do 3.072 (0x60) or 3.104 (0x61). I put 3.104A for now. \n\nLet me know if the value is ok.",
      "parentUuid": "50664354_36b82912",
      "revId": "3f7e43196186c36103b1433f2d89e23bffcc9765",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
